NOTICE

LandGuard is a decision-support prototype. Risk assessments produced by this
software are indicative and are not a substitute for official geological
assessment or statutory warnings issued by competent disaster management
authorities.

Third-party Earth-observation and environmental data accessed by this software
(including data from ESA/Copernicus, JAXA, NASA, Open-Meteo and the Microsoft
Planetary Computer) remains the property of its respective providers and is
subject to their own licence terms. This MIT licence covers the LandGuard
source code only.
